  {
   "id": "mining-mechs-266440@major-2026-10-22",
   "gameId": "mining-mechs-266440",
   "displayName": "Overhaul Update Out Now! Mining Mechs Third Anniversary",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-22T14:29:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone! Hope you're all doing well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mining Mechs is turning 3 years old, and to celebrate I’m releasing the biggest update the game has ever had: a complete overhaul, free for everyone and out now. It’s still the Mining Mechs you know, with the same gameplay and the same look. But under the hood it’s been rebuilt to run smoother, play better in co-op, and stay ready for years of updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What’s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A complete GUI re-design. A sleek new look to all of the GUI in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better co-op. Leaner networking, better syncing, plus many stability fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Any screen, any shape. From 4:3 all the way to 32:9 ultrawide. The game also remembers your window size and position.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Safer progress. Settings save the moment you change them, and autosave keeps running while the game is in the background.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Smarter pipes. T-splits start growing right away instead of waiting for the main pipe.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "No more lag deep underground. The slowdown below 700 m is gone, and the game runs smoother at every depth.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus plenty of bug fixes and stability improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Why now?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "When I made Mining Mechs, I was just making games for fun. I’m not a programmer by trade, and the code was the best I could do at the time, even if it made bugs hard to fix. I never expected hundreds of thousands of you to play it! I’ve learned a lot in the three years since, and this overhaul puts every one of those lessons back into the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The whole family",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Mining Mechs is not the only game I'm revamping. Super Mining Mechs and Mining Merchant get the same overhaul today, so I can keep supporting the whole series. And Mining Merchant’s Dino Discovery DLC lands next week!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Thank you!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks for sticking with me for three years. This game truly changed my life, and I can’t thank you enough. See you down there!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
